# Refining Remi's Outfit - Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Resolve the persistent "Remi's outfit is different" issue in `EP06.5_72の法則.md`. Despite previous synchronization with `EP04.6_偏見の壁.md`, the black lace high-neck camisole is not rendering consistently (often appearing as a V-neck or lower cut). I will modify the prompt to explicitly enforce the high-neck feature and ensure it matches the user's expectations for a strict character lock.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> I am proposing to change `((Black Lace High-neck Camisole))` to `((Black Lace High-neck Top))` or add `((Turtleneck))` to strengthen the visual lock. This is a deviation from the previous "Camisole" wording but aims to achieve the correct visual result.

